<title>BOSNIA: Bosnia Feb retail prices down 0.1 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Bosnia Feb retail prices down 0.1 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>SARAJEVO 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistics Bureau of Bosnia's Moslem-Croat federation issued the following economic indicator details on Monday.</p>
<p>    BOSNIA RETAIL PRICES		 MARCH    FEB     MARCH 96</p>
<p>    Monthly change (pct)		 -0.1     +1.0    +O.3</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change		  +12.0    +11.4   -27.8</p>
<p>NOTES -- The data cover 51 percent of Bosnia-Hercegovina territory. Data for remaining 49 percent are not available.</p>
<p>Retail prices in Jan-March 1997 rose by 10.9 percent compared to the same period in 1996, the office said.</p>
<p>-- Sarajevo newsroom, +387-71-663-864.</p>
</text>
